  "body": "Refs #368 (C.1, documentation coherence)\nClaim: cloud/docs-steward\nDirect-PR: docs counts only, no lot\n\n## Problem\nREADME and ROADMAP printed the 2026-10-29 counts (39 of 67 engine lots, 6 of 75 app lots, M1 36 of 41, M3 15 of 43) and listed LOT-084, LOT-170 and #300 as in review.\n\n## What changed\nCounts recomputed from `docs/LOTS.md` and the tracker (issue closed as completed = done): engine 49 of 67, app 9 of 80, M1 38 of 41, M2 1 of 38, M3 25 of 43, M4 0 of 31, 153 lots. The MVP sentence now lists what is really left: LOT-137, LOT-169, LOT-161 and the Mac checks #344 and #322. No other document prints these counts (checked with a grep of README, docs/, AGENTS.md); the live numbers stay on the boards.\n\n## Tests\nmarkdownlint-cli2: 0 errors. The numbers come from `tooling/roadmap/generate.py` (PR #370).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_014QH2CFZnKsDrPqZ8BiDUrL)_\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Updated project progress, milestone completion counts, and roadmap status through November 1, 2026.\n  * Refreshed the list of open MVP work, including link handling, text sizing, TestFlight, and Mac checks.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
